  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9e350b8b-3e92-5a19-a663-93dd558b880a" activityNameId="34741414-f26d-5ebe-81f9-f482ac983eca" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at heat pump, air-water, 50kW, certified electricity, in new building</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at heat pump, air-water, 50kW, certified electricity, in new building
Heat from a air-water heat pump, 50kW with certified electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heating system is 20 years. SPF=4.6. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year. 
UUID: cebc3ff1-5dc0-3467-8f51-4294cd6bf9b6
Included are the share of the production of the air-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ.
The use of certified electricity mix (CH) is calculated by the  SPF of 4.6 for a new building, apartment house.
Also the loss of coolant (2% in a year) is included.
There are NO end of life processes included. Only the deposit of waste during the construction or usephase are included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. 
Technology: 
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cebc3ff1-5dc0-3467-8f51-4294cd6bf9b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
